 "<div><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:.8em;height:.8em;border-radius:.2em;background:#e8f4fd;margin-right:.45em\"></span>Hielo 68,7 %</div><div><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:.8em;height:.8em;border-radius:.2em;background:#7fb8e6;margin-right:.45em\"></span>Subterránea 30,1 %</div><div><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:.8em;height:.8em;border-radius:.2em;background:#50e3c2;margin-right:.45em\"></span>Ríos y lagos 1,2 %</div>": "<div><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:.8em;height:.8em;border-radius:.2em;background:#e8f4fd;margin-right:.45em\"></span>IJs 68,7 %</div><div><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:.8em;height:.8em;border-radius:.2em;background:#7fb8e6;margin-right:.45em\"></span>Grondwater 30,1 %</div><div><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:.8em;height:.8em;border-radius:.2em;background:#50e3c2;margin-right:.45em\"></span>Rivieren en meren 1,2 %</div>",
